    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Limitra uses this permission only to detect when a restricted app is opened, in order to enforce your digital boundaries and app limits. All data is processed locally on your device; no data is collected or exported. Background tracking is solely for executing your chosen block rules.</string>
    <string name="notification_channel_service">Limitra Protection Service</string>
    <string name="notification_channel_service_desc">Runs to keep protection active and locally enforce the limits you set. Your data remains entirely on your device.</string>
