    <string name="profile_data_usage_desc1">• Limitra uses usage access to calculate how much time you spend on selected apps.\n\n</string>
    <string name="profile_data_usage_desc2">• Selected app information is used to show the lock screen (via accessibility and overlay) when the time limit is reached.\n\n</string>
